aptX Adaptive integration patches for crDroid
Source snapshot: 2026-10-01; production reference: v39.

UPSTREAM SOURCES AND COMPATIBILITY

This distribution contains source-code diffs against AOSP-derived crDroid
repositories. It is not a ROM image or an implementation of the proprietary
aptX encoder. Encoding uses the compatible device's existing Qualcomm audio
provider and DSP firmware; no vendor firmware, proprietary libraries, vendor
APKs or SDK binaries are included here.

The affected AOSP-derived Bluetooth, framework and Settings files retain
their upstream Apache License, Version 2.0, terms and attribution notices.
Upstream file notices include The Android Open Source Project and Broadcom
Corporation. GameSpace also carries Apache License, Version 2.0; its affected
sources include crDroid Android Project and AxionOS notices. Retain the actual
copyright and attribution notices of each affected source file. This overview
does not replace the upstream per-file notices or license an entire ROM tree.

